  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Municipality Development Program</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa de Desarrollo Municipal</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">TO SUPPORT THE MEXICAN GOVERNMENT IN FOSTERING MUNICIPAL DEVELOPMENT. THE PROGRAM WOULD HAVE TWO COMPONENTS: (1) INVESTMENT TO PROVIDE AND INSTALL EQUIPMENT IN MUNICIPALITIES FOR: (A)SLAUGHTHER-HOUSES, (B)SUPPLY WAREHOUSES,(C) MUNICIPAL MARKETS, (D)BUS TERMINALS AND (E)THE COLLECTION AND DISPOSAL OF SOLID WASTE, INCLUDING PROJECT PREPARATION COSTS; AND (2) INSTITUTIONAL STRENGTHENING FOR THE MUNICIPALITIES.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES"></narrative>
  </description>
